  "body": "**What.** The coordinator proposes, Nathan decides, whether rows carry the release step as an error kind.\n\n**Why.** Digest, the digits line (open).\n\n**Acceptance (each can fail).**\n- The decision is recorded in [notes/BIAS.md](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/notes/BIAS.md).\n- If yes, `export_delta_all.py` writes the kind with its meaning (a measurement of the bias, not a correction), and `--verify` passes.\n\n**Files.** [hp/export_delta_all.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/hp/export_delta_all.py), [hp/data/delta_all.csv](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/hp/data/delta_all.csv), [notes/BIAS.md](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/notes/BIAS.md)",
